WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration

3
01:25.000 --> 01:30.000
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse

4
01:33.160 --> 01:34.479
Dong Beihu, you...

5
01:34.520 --> 01:37.320
Where is your alcohol dehydrogenase? Where is it?

6
01:38.080 --> 01:38.479
Where is...

7
01:38.479 --> 01:39.560
Shut up. Hurry.

8
01:39.560 --> 01:40.880
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

9
01:43.240 --> 01:44.320
So embarrassing.

10
01:45.720 --> 01:49.120
Life is but a few short autumns.

11
01:54.840 --> 01:55.920
Why are you here?

12
01:56.320 --> 01:58.160
In the east, my...

13
02:04.080 --> 02:04.720
Get in.

14
02:32.040 --> 02:33.240
What a coincidence.

15
02:36.400 --> 02:39.040
Super coincidental. I just happened to pass by.

16
02:39.040 --> 02:40.560
What do you mean, pass by?

17
02:41.040 --> 02:42.680
Your place isn't on the way.

18
02:43.760 --> 02:44.560
Did you move?

19
02:46.280 --> 02:48.610
I was afraid you'd get too drunk to go home.

20
02:48.680 --> 02:49.940
I can handle my liquor.

21
02:52.720 --> 02:53.560
I'm telling you,

22
02:53.560 --> 02:54.760
if you judge like this,

23
02:54.760 --> 02:56.420
I definitely won't accept it.

24
02:56.800 --> 02:57.560
Okay, let's go.

25
02:57.560 --> 02:59.480
I haven't finished yet. Put the cup down.

26
02:59.480 --> 03:00.000
Put the cup down.

27
03:00.000 --> 03:01.760
Can't we just have a nice chat?

28
03:01.840 --> 03:04.280
Let me tell you why I don't accept it.

29
03:04.280 --> 03:05.120
It accepted it.

30
03:05.120 --> 03:06.480
It didn't.

31
03:06.480 --> 03:07.560
Thank you, judge.

32
03:08.280 --> 03:09.200
Thank you, really.

33
03:09.200 --> 03:11.200
I, Xiao Longnv, will remember this.

34
03:11.920 --> 03:13.280
You really...

35
03:13.560 --> 03:14.480
Stop playing with your phone.

36
03:14.480 --> 03:15.760
In such a formal occasion,

37
03:15.760 --> 03:17.680
stop playing with your phone, okay? Listen to me.

38
03:17.680 --> 03:18.280
Okay. What do you want?

39
03:18.280 --> 03:18.960
Come here and thank it. Come.

40
03:18.960 --> 03:20.400
I won't. It's too hard.

41
03:20.400 --> 03:21.680
You are so ignorant.

42
03:21.680 --> 03:23.940
He's ignorant. Let's not argue with him.

43
03:29.400 --> 03:30.480
Drive slowly.

44
03:41.120 --> 03:42.520
It's been so long, you...

45
03:43.680 --> 03:45.280
I can't forget this.

46
03:48.640 --> 03:49.920
Xiaolong, actually, for this case,

47
03:49.920 --> 03:52.050
if it were a different region or judge,

48
03:53.040 --> 03:55.500
the verdict might have been very different.

49
03:58.000 --> 03:58.680
I know.

50
03:59.120 --> 04:00.720
You don't need to comfort me.

51
04:01.160 --> 04:03.280
Winning and losing are common in battle.

52
04:03.280 --> 04:05.540
I'm an adult, how could I not understand?

53
04:06.160 --> 04:09.000
A loss is a loss. I accept it.

54
04:12.400 --> 04:14.280
I will also urge Shengkang Insurance

55
04:14.280 --> 04:17.339
to strengthen the standard training for their agents.

56
04:17.640 --> 04:19.120
They must explain all the clauses

57
04:19.120 --> 04:19.880
and restrictions

58
04:19.880 --> 04:22.740
to the clients more carefully and professionally.

59
04:23.280 --> 04:25.120
And the definition of diseases in the contract

60
04:25.120 --> 04:26.980
should be further standardized.

61
04:27.120 --> 04:28.400
That would be best,

62
04:29.000 --> 04:31.400
to prevent inequality from the source.

63
04:34.840 --> 04:36.000
Anyway,

64
04:37.360 --> 04:39.080
you are a good opponent.

65
04:41.120 --> 04:41.880
You too.

66
04:44.120 --> 04:45.560
Why do I feel so nauseous?

67
04:47.400 --> 04:48.600
Where is this?

68
04:49.600 --> 04:50.800
Did we change venues?

69
04:56.680 --> 04:58.000
Not bad, Xiao Longnv.

70
04:58.520 --> 05:00.280
You even called a luxury car.

71
05:11.160 --> 05:12.560
Luo Zhi, come give me a hand. Quick.

72
05:12.560 --> 05:13.400
What's wrong, Director? Let me help.

73
05:13.400 --> 05:14.120
Quick.

74
05:15.280 --> 05:15.880
Lawyer Li.

75
05:16.400 --> 05:17.840
How did Uncle get so drunk?

76
05:17.840 --> 05:19.200
Doesn't he have some kind of antibody?

77
05:19.200 --> 05:21.160
He has nothing. It's a total lie.

78
05:21.160 --> 05:22.120
Oh my god.

79
05:22.400 --> 05:23.120
Slow down. There are steps.

80
05:23.120 --> 05:23.800
No need.

81
05:24.680 --> 05:25.810
I'll walk by myself.

82
05:29.840 --> 05:31.520
One, two, three.

83
05:31.560 --> 05:32.680
Be careful.

84
05:33.040 --> 05:34.360
Watch your back.

85
05:34.400 --> 05:35.600
Thank you, Lawyer Li.

86
06:04.360 --> 06:05.420
Come here quickly.

87
06:06.480 --> 06:08.410
Have some tofu pudding to sober up.

88
06:08.560 --> 06:11.240
I'm fine. It's all evaporated.

89
06:11.720 --> 06:12.800
Evaporated?

90
06:12.800 --> 06:13.720
Dad knows you drank.

91
06:13.720 --> 06:15.320
You feel bad after drinking.

92
06:17.120 --> 06:17.480
Xiaolong.

93
06:17.480 --> 06:19.160
When will the cycle of revenge end?

94
06:19.160 --> 06:20.480
What's the next line?

95
06:20.600 --> 06:22.360
Only envy mandarin ducks, not immortals.

96
06:22.360 --> 06:23.690
Stop talking nonsense.

97
06:24.480 --> 06:26.080
Be forgiving when possible.

98
06:26.480 --> 06:27.160
Really?

99
06:30.480 --> 06:32.920
Why are you beating around the bush?

100
06:32.920 --> 06:34.240
Just say it straight.

101
06:34.920 --> 06:35.680
No, I...

102
06:35.680 --> 06:37.610
Because I understand how you feel.

103
06:37.680 --> 06:40.080
Because I've never lost a fight in the past.

104
06:40.680 --> 06:41.800
No, no, no.

105
06:42.040 --> 06:43.600
I lost once.

106
06:44.040 --> 06:46.040
To Zhao Deqing, your Uncle Daqing.

107
06:46.040 --> 06:47.159
You two fought?

108
06:47.159 --> 06:48.600
Weren't you on the same side?

109
06:48.600 --> 06:50.240
We didn't know each other then.

110
06:50.240 --> 06:50.920
We didn't.

111
06:51.159 --> 06:52.480
Once we got into a big fight.

112
06:52.480 --> 06:53.409
After the fight,

113
06:53.600 --> 06:54.159
we fought back and forth,

114
06:54.159 --> 06:55.840
and became brothers.

115
06:57.040 --> 06:58.040
Dad, what do you mean?

116
06:58.040 --> 06:59.040
Do you mean

117
06:59.040 --> 07:00.680
I should take Li Xin as my underling?

118
07:00.680 --> 07:02.240
No, what underling?

119
07:02.680 --> 07:04.920
I'm telling you the principle of turning enemies into friends.

120
07:04.920 --> 07:07.160
If you two keep fighting like this,

121
07:07.160 --> 07:08.360
when will it end?

122
07:08.680 --> 07:10.160
But if you join forces with Xiaoxin,

123
07:10.160 --> 07:10.720
then...

124
07:10.720 --> 07:12.160
how many big cases will you solve in the future?

125
07:12.160 --> 07:12.600
Right?

126
07:14.040 --> 07:14.920
Does what I say make sense?

127
07:14.920 --> 07:16.600
Yes, you see the big picture.

128
07:16.600 --> 07:18.600
You see, when it comes to employing people,

129
07:18.600 --> 07:20.130
your dad is very strategic.

130
07:20.240 --> 07:22.920
It's called maneuvering and being far-sighted.

131
07:22.920 --> 07:25.800
Dad, how do you write 'maneuvering'?

132
07:27.800 --> 07:28.480
It's...

133
07:29.800 --> 07:31.160
Why are you asking me this?

134
07:31.160 --> 07:33.040
With your education, you should know this word.

135
07:33.040 --> 07:33.800
Yes, my bad.

136
07:33.800 --> 07:35.560
I'll look it up later.

137
07:38.360 --> 07:39.159
Manager Xiao,

138
07:39.240 --> 07:40.100
what time is it?

139
07:40.240 --> 07:41.360
What time is it?

140
07:46.720 --> 07:48.000
Slow down.

141
07:56.360 --> 07:57.360
What happened again?

142
07:57.360 --> 07:58.480
Did you pull a muscle?

143
07:58.480 --> 08:00.480
I took a drunkard home last night.

144
08:01.160 --> 08:03.280
Who? Xiao?

145
08:03.720 --> 08:04.800
She's not heavy.

146
08:05.160 --> 08:05.800
She's not heavy.

147
08:05.800 --> 08:07.400
No, it wasn't her.

148
08:10.400 --> 08:11.730
Help... help me lift it.

149
08:12.160 --> 08:13.840
You should be more careful.

150
08:14.040 --> 08:15.640
Make yourself comfortable.

151
08:20.600 --> 08:22.860
After all these years, tell me the truth.

152
08:23.800 --> 08:26.000
How did you really get this injury?

153
08:26.280 --> 08:27.400
Bitten by a dog.

154
08:27.400 --> 08:28.600
Do you think I really can't tell?

155
08:28.600 --> 08:30.160
This is a sharp force injury.

156
08:30.160 --> 08:31.720
Half a centimeter off, and it would have hit your spine.

157
08:31.720 --> 08:34.450
You'd be in a wheelchair for the rest of your life.

158
08:36.480 --> 08:38.880
Forget it if you don't want to talk about it.

159
08:39.159 --> 08:41.360
If there's anything you can't get over,

160
08:41.559 --> 08:45.760
our hospital's psychological rehabilitation department is pretty good.

161
08:45.800 --> 08:47.160
It's long gone.

162
09:34.920 --> 09:35.800
Yesterday,

163
09:36.000 --> 09:37.680
was I really brought back by that suitcase?

164
09:37.680 --> 09:39.160
Would I lie to you?

165
09:39.480 --> 09:42.720
Lawyer Li escorted you all the way to your bed.

166
09:44.240 --> 09:46.120
Why don't I have any memory of it?

167
09:46.120 --> 09:46.480
Uncle.

168
09:46.480 --> 09:48.000
You were so drunk.

169
09:48.120 --> 09:49.980
How could you remember anything?

170
09:51.800 --> 09:53.360
My shoulder hurts so much.

171
09:53.480 --> 09:55.740
Did he sneak-attack me while I was drunk?

172
10:00.360 --> 10:01.720
What? What did you see?

173
10:04.120 --> 10:04.840
I know, Uncle.

174
10:04.840 --> 10:05.840
He hit me.

175
10:05.840 --> 10:06.840
No, no, no.

176
10:06.840 --> 10:08.240
Let's say you're Lawyer Li,

177
10:08.240 --> 10:09.120
and I'm you.

178
10:09.520 --> 10:10.720
Lawyer Li is tall.

179
10:10.720 --> 10:11.840
He was holding you up, right?

180
10:11.840 --> 10:12.480
You had your arm around him.

181
10:12.480 --> 10:13.360
You were so heavy.

182
10:13.360 --> 10:14.720
When you dropped your weight,

183
10:14.720 --> 10:15.850
your shoulder hurt.

184
10:16.000 --> 10:16.860
Get out of here.

185
10:17.240 --> 10:18.370
Is he taller than me?

186
10:18.640 --> 10:19.720
I'm 1.83 meters tall barefoot.

187
10:19.720 --> 10:21.000
My legs alone are 1.2 meters long.

188
10:21.000 --> 10:22.600
Does he have my proportions?

189
10:24.240 --> 10:25.720
He must be this much taller than you.

190
10:25.720 --> 10:28.120
He's only taller because he was wearing leather shoes.

191
10:28.120 --> 10:29.120
I was wearing sneakers

192
10:29.120 --> 10:30.050
with flat soles.

193
10:30.240 --> 10:32.240
You haven't even joined the law firm yet.

194
10:32.240 --> 10:34.480
Can you watch what you say?

195
10:34.840 --> 10:35.840
Who is taller?

196
10:36.840 --> 10:37.720
You are.

197
10:38.240 --> 10:39.000
You are. You are.

198
10:39.000 --> 10:40.930
Stop talking. Sister Long is here.

199
10:53.480 --> 10:54.360
What is it?

200
10:56.000 --> 10:57.120
Why are you looking at me?

201
10:57.120 --> 10:58.520
Are your eyes glued to me?

202
11:03.160 --> 11:04.040
It's nothing.

203
11:04.480 --> 11:05.840
You... alright.

204
11:07.120 --> 11:07.720
Anyway,

205
11:10.000 --> 11:12.200
let's summarize our failed experience

206
11:12.240 --> 11:13.120
and review it.

207
11:13.240 --> 11:14.600
Luo Zhi, go get your summary report

208
11:14.600 --> 11:15.600
and bring it to me.

209
11:16.360 --> 11:19.720
From now on, you'll be responsible for our law firm's reception records

210
11:19.720 --> 11:21.840
and case data collection.

211
11:25.240 --> 11:27.240
What are you staring at? Get to work.

212
11:30.640 --> 11:31.720
Okay, Lawyer Xiao.

213
11:32.480 --> 11:35.480
This kid really needs to change his habit of making a fuss over nothing.

214
11:35.480 --> 11:36.360
What's wrong?

215
11:36.360 --> 11:37.840
Is my staircase okay?

216
11:48.240 --> 11:48.720
Congratulations, Master,

217
11:48.720 --> 11:50.360
on securing the long-term contract with Shengkang Insurance

218
11:50.360 --> 11:51.360
and completing Department Two's

219
11:51.360 --> 11:52.120
KPI for this year ahead of schedule.

220
11:52.120 --> 11:54.000
The main thing is that we beat Xiao Longnv.

221
11:54.000 --> 11:55.400
Wonderful.

222
11:56.360 --> 11:57.440
It was all his idea.

223
11:58.120 --> 11:58.720
Okay.

224
11:58.720 --> 12:00.480
You clean this up later.

225
12:01.120 --> 12:01.780
Have a seat.

226
12:04.240 --> 12:05.840
Everyone has worked hard recently.

227
12:05.840 --> 12:07.600
I'm treating everyone to dinner this Friday.

228
12:07.600 --> 12:08.640
Ruoqi, help me book a restaurant.

229
12:08.640 --> 12:10.000
Sure, leave it to me.

230
12:10.000 --> 12:10.600
Okay.

231
12:11.240 --> 12:12.840
Let's talk about the plan for this week.

232
12:12.840 --> 12:14.240
The legal director of Star Alliance Airlines

233
12:14.240 --> 12:15.720
sent me a link this morning.

234
12:15.720 --> 12:17.000
He said a passenger

235
12:17.000 --> 12:18.720
filmed a video on a flight

236
12:18.720 --> 12:20.480
showing poor service by the crew.

237
12:20.480 --> 12:22.360
It has already attracted some attention.

238
12:22.360 --> 12:24.360
They are afraid that if the video continues to spread,

239
12:24.360 --> 12:26.480
it will have a negative impact on the company's image.

240
12:26.480 --> 12:28.600
They want us to send a letter to the platform to take down the video.

241
12:28.600 --> 12:30.600
Okay, I'll leave this matter to you.

242
12:31.480 --> 12:33.480
You two are just chatting here, huh?

243
12:33.480 --> 12:35.240
The water just boiled. I was about to bring it to you.

244
12:35.240 --> 12:36.080
I won't listen to your excuses.

245
12:36.080 --> 12:36.840
I'll report this to the airline.

246
12:36.840 --> 12:38.040
What kind of service attitude is this?

247
12:38.040 --> 12:39.300
Sir, please calm down.

248
12:39.840 --> 12:41.320
That was the situation at the time.

249
12:41.320 --> 12:43.180
That passenger seemed to be sick.

250
12:43.840 --> 12:44.680
He asked for hot water several times.

251
12:44.680 --> 12:45.720
But the flight attendant didn't serve him.

252
12:45.720 --> 12:46.680
Then they started arguing.

253
12:46.680 --> 12:47.360
I have a fever of 40 degrees!

254
12:47.360 --> 12:48.760
What kind of service is this?

255
12:48.760 --> 12:49.480
We understand.

256
12:49.480 --> 12:50.360
I'm going to file a complaint against her, you know?

257
12:50.360 --> 12:51.520
Yes, I am the chief purser.

258
12:51.520 --> 12:52.440
Please tell me if you have any issues.

259
12:52.440 --> 12:53.840
You're the chief purser? I'll complain about you too!

260
12:53.840 --> 12:54.600
What's your name?

261
12:54.600 --> 12:55.240
Sir, please don't.

262
12:55.240 --> 12:55.840
What's your name?

263
12:55.840 --> 12:56.720
Don't do this.

264
12:57.120 --> 12:59.120
You're not going to tell me, are you?

265
13:00.640 --> 13:02.000
This is too much.

266
13:03.640 --> 13:06.000
Jiayi, you must be terrified.

267
13:09.840 --> 13:10.600
Miaomiao.

268
13:11.840 --> 13:13.120
Can you do me a favor?

269
13:14.000 --> 13:15.520
Don't you work at Honghu?

270
13:16.240 --> 13:18.300
Can you introduce me to a good lawyer?

271
13:29.480 --> 13:32.640
Actually, I've already resigned from Honghu.

272
13:32.640 --> 13:35.370
But I haven't dared to tell my parents about this.

273
13:35.480 --> 13:38.080
If they knew, they definitely wouldn't agree.

274
13:40.120 --> 13:41.480
Then what are you doing now?

275
13:41.480 --> 13:42.480
I'm now working independently

276
13:42.480 --> 13:45.000
with a really good lawyer.

277
13:45.000 --> 13:46.240
She used to be at Honghu too.

278
13:46.240 --> 13:47.240
She's amazing.

279
13:47.240 --> 13:49.600
How about I tell her about your situation?

280
13:49.640 --> 13:51.840
She can definitely get justice for you.

281
13:54.840 --> 13:57.720
Brother, just put your heart back in your chest,

282
13:57.720 --> 13:58.480
okay?

283
13:58.600 --> 13:59.840
The cases our law firm handles

284
13:59.840 --> 14:00.720
are much more complicated than yours,

285
14:00.720 --> 14:02.320
and we won them all in the end.

286
14:04.720 --> 14:05.120
Okay.

287
14:05.120 --> 14:06.720
Jiayi, this is our law firm.

288
14:06.720 --> 14:07.520
Have a seat.

289
14:08.000 --> 14:09.600
You're Miaomiao's classmate, right?

290
14:09.600 --> 14:10.640
I'm Miaomiao's Brother Hu.

291
14:10.640 --> 14:11.840
You can call me Brother Hu too.

292
14:11.840 --> 14:12.480
Sit.

293
14:12.480 --> 14:12.840
We're all friends here, sit.

294
14:12.840 --> 14:14.240
You sit. I'll go get you some water.

295
14:14.240 --> 14:15.000
Come, sit.

296
14:15.640 --> 14:16.240
Sit.

297
14:18.240 --> 14:19.840
Come, have some sunflower seeds.

298
14:19.840 --> 14:20.600
These seeds are really good,

299
14:20.600 --> 14:21.860
not stale at all. Come.

300
14:22.600 --> 14:24.480
Hello, I'm Luo Zhi.

301
14:24.640 --> 14:25.600
I'm also part of the team.

302
14:25.600 --> 14:27.240
Right, if you have any problems, just say it.

303
14:27.240 --> 14:27.900
Brother Hu,

304
14:28.000 --> 14:29.000
go do your work.

305
14:29.480 --> 14:31.140
Here, have some water, Jiayi.

306
14:31.440 --> 14:32.640
Come, come over here.

307
14:36.120 --> 14:39.180
How much commission do you get for bringing in a client?

308
14:39.480 --> 14:40.360
Five hundred?

309
14:40.360 --> 14:41.840
I'll slap you.

310
14:42.360 --> 14:44.240
This is my classmate. I'm helping her out.

311
14:44.240 --> 14:46.480
You look like an idiot. Get out.

312
14:46.960 --> 14:47.620
Step aside.

313
14:47.920 --> 14:48.480
You,

314
14:49.480 --> 14:50.840
you go with your uncle.

315
14:55.840 --> 14:57.000
It's okay.

316
14:59.840 --> 15:01.170
What are you looking at?

317
15:03.120 --> 15:04.850
The client's look isn't right.

318
15:05.120 --> 15:06.050
What do you mean?

319
15:06.480 --> 15:08.360
She probably thinks you're a hooligan.

320
15:08.360 --> 15:10.120
What? I'm a very civilized person.

321
15:10.120 --> 15:11.120
I'm a hooligan?

322
15:11.120 --> 15:13.180
Uncle, you call yourself civilized?

323
15:13.480 --> 15:14.840
Good morning, Director.

324
15:14.840 --> 15:17.240
You startled me with your sudden outburst.

325
15:17.600 --> 15:20.240
Look at how sunny and positive he is,

326
15:20.400 --> 15:22.400
unlike you, looking gloomy all day.

327
15:24.240 --> 15:25.280
Very good. Keep it up.

328
15:25.280 --> 15:26.480
After you, Director.

329
15:28.000 --> 15:29.840
When it comes to kissing up,

330
15:30.120 --> 15:31.240
you're the master.

331
15:31.840 --> 15:32.840
It's not kissing up.

332
15:32.840 --> 15:35.600
Leaders in big law firms are all called directors.

333
15:35.600 --> 15:37.360
Which Popeye is called a director?

334
15:37.360 --> 15:38.720
Big law firm.

335
15:38.720 --> 15:40.980
Big law firm. Go get your tongue checked.

336
15:48.360 --> 15:51.000
Jiayi, I've already watched the video.

337
15:51.240 --> 15:54.000
Could you tell me more about what happened then?

338
15:55.120 --> 15:57.480
While the plane was descending,

339
15:58.600 --> 16:00.000
he asked me for hot water.

340
16:02.360 --> 16:04.120
Ladies and gentlemen,

341
16:04.120 --> 16:05.520
the plane is descending.

342
16:05.640 --> 16:07.640
Please return to your seats

343
16:07.640 --> 16:09.170
and fasten your seatbelts.

344
16:15.840 --> 16:16.840
Hello, Mr. Hu.

345
16:16.840 --> 16:18.000
How can I help you?

346
16:18.720 --> 16:21.000
Bring me a cup of hot water and a hot towel.

347
16:21.240 --> 16:22.320
I'm sorry, Mr. Hu.

348
16:22.600 --> 16:24.400
Our plane is currently descending.

349
16:24.400 --> 16:26.000
Our food carts have been sealed.

350
16:26.000 --> 16:28.000
I'll bring it to you as soon as we land.

351
16:28.000 --> 16:28.840
I can't wait.

352
16:28.840 --> 16:30.360
I have a bad cold right now.

353
16:30.360 --> 16:33.000
I just want some hot water, okay?

354
16:33.840 --> 16:36.520
Okay, I'll go ask the chief purser.

355
16:37.000 --> 16:38.360
What's wrong with you guys?

356
16:38.360 --> 16:39.600
You were already delayed.

357
16:39.600 --> 16:41.640
And now it's so hard just to get some water.

358
16:41.640 --> 16:42.600
Hurry up.

359
16:42.600 --> 16:44.000
Sorry for the trouble.

360
16:45.880 --> 16:48.000
Chief purser, a passenger wants hot water.

361
16:48.000 --> 16:49.160
For safety reasons,

362
16:49.360 --> 16:52.220
give him a bottle of room-temperature water first.

363
16:53.360 --> 16:54.480
Mr. Hu, your water.

364
16:55.840 --> 16:56.600
What is this?

365
16:56.840 --> 16:57.840
No, I want hot water.

366
16:57.840 --> 16:59.480
Why did you bring me cold water?

367
16:59.480 --> 17:00.720
Can't you understand human speech?

368
17:00.720 --> 17:01.840
I have a fever right now.

369
17:01.840 --> 17:02.840
My whole body is shivering.

370
17:02.840 --> 17:03.840
And you give me cold water.

371
17:03.840 --> 17:05.480
What? Are you trying to kill me?

372
17:05.480 --> 17:06.720
Mr. Hu, please let me explain.

373
17:06.720 --> 17:08.599
Explain what? What kind of service is this?

374
17:08.599 --> 17:09.960
I want hot water.

375
17:10.480 --> 17:12.119
Go get me hot water right now.

376
17:12.119 --> 17:12.839
I'm sorry, Mr. Hu.

377
17:12.839 --> 17:14.000
Please don't be angry.

378
17:14.000 --> 17:16.400
I'll go resolve the hot water issue for you.

379
17:18.240 --> 17:20.599
Chief Purser, that passenger insists on hot water.

380
17:20.599 --> 17:21.839
He says room temperature is too cold.

381
17:21.839 --> 17:23.640
But the plane is about to land.

382
17:23.839 --> 17:25.599
But he looks really uncomfortable.

383
17:25.599 --> 17:28.119
Can we make an exception and give it to him?

384
17:28.119 --> 17:28.600
How about this.

385
17:28.600 --> 17:29.600
You go boil it first,

386
17:29.600 --> 17:31.360
and bring it to him after we land.

387
17:31.360 --> 17:31.880
Okay.

388
17:36.840 --> 17:38.400
Ladies and gentlemen,

389
17:38.520 --> 17:41.760
our flight has safely arrived at its destination.

390
17:43.000 --> 17:44.840
Chief Purser, my work is done.

391
17:44.840 --> 17:46.480
I'll go bring it to that passenger.

392
17:46.480 --> 17:47.840
I've been waiting there for hot water,

393
17:47.840 --> 17:49.120
and you two are just chatting here, huh?

394
17:49.120 --> 17:50.240
Sir, the water just boiled.

395
17:50.240 --> 17:50.720
I was just about to bring it to you.

396
17:50.720 --> 17:51.520
What do you mean just about to?

397
17:51.520 --> 17:52.520
What kind of service attitude is that?

398
17:52.520 --> 17:53.240
Sir, sir.

399
17:53.240 --> 17:54.120
What's your name? Please calm down.

400
17:54.120 --> 17:54.480
Please take a seat first.

401
17:54.480 --> 17:55.360
I'm not going back to my seat.

402
17:55.360 --> 17:56.600
When the plane was in the air,

403
17:56.600 --> 17:57.360
I asked you to get water.

404
17:57.360 --> 17:58.480
Now we've landed.

405
17:58.480 --> 17:59.720
I have a fever of 40 degrees.

406
17:59.720 --> 18:00.840
I'm burning up! What are you doing?

407
18:00.840 --> 18:01.600
Sir, I'm the Chief Purser.

408
18:01.600 --> 18:03.240
Talk to me if you have an issue. Why should I talk to you?

409
18:03.240 --> 18:04.360
I'll complain about you too.

410
18:04.360 --> 18:05.320
What's your name?

411
18:05.320 --> 18:07.000
I don't want you. I want to complain about her.

412
18:07.000 --> 18:08.120
Let me see. You have a name tag, right?

413
18:08.120 --> 18:08.920
Let me see what your name is.

414
18:08.920 --> 18:09.680
Sir, what kind of behavior is this?

415
18:09.680 --> 18:11.200
I'm just looking at the tag, what behavior?

416
18:11.200 --> 18:11.800
Let me see.

417
18:20.880 --> 18:23.480
I heard you called the police later, right?

418
18:24.240 --> 18:25.000
Yes.

419
18:25.720 --> 18:27.000
But the police said

420
18:27.880 --> 18:31.320
it didn't reach the level of criminal molestation,

421
18:33.000 --> 18:34.460
so they didn't file a case.

422
18:34.480 --> 18:36.760
So do you want to sue him

423
18:37.280 --> 18:38.480
for molestation now?

424
18:39.480 --> 18:41.940
Actually, I respect the police's decision.

425
18:44.200 --> 18:45.000
It's just that

426
18:46.240 --> 18:47.480
psychologically,

427
18:47.480 --> 18:49.480
I'm having some problems right now.

428
18:49.520 --> 18:53.000
I failed the airline's regular assessment,

429
18:53.160 --> 18:54.480
so I can't fly now.

430
18:55.240 --> 18:57.570
The doctor also told me to rest for a while.

431
18:58.000 --> 19:00.480
But whenever I think of that scene,

432
19:02.480 --> 19:05.000
I don't understand what I did wrong.

433
19:11.480 --> 19:12.480
Lawyer Xiao.

434
19:14.240 --> 19:16.280
I want to seek justice for myself.

435
19:17.920 --> 19:19.640
I want him to apologize to me.

436
19:20.480 --> 19:23.640
Sister Long, Jiayi used to be very cheerful.

437
19:24.080 --> 19:27.040
I've never seen her in this state before.

438
19:27.720 --> 19:28.480
She's gone.

439
19:29.000 --> 19:29.640
What kind of case is it?

440
19:29.640 --> 19:31.370
I think this girl is a bit weird.

441
19:31.480 --> 19:32.720
Watch your mouth.

442
19:32.720 --> 19:34.200
What do you mean weird?

443
19:34.200 --> 19:35.480
You're the weird one.

444
19:35.640 --> 19:38.000
No, I mean her mental state seems very poor.

445
19:38.000 --> 19:39.160
She's sick.

446
19:39.480 --> 19:41.000
She has ASD.

447
19:41.280 --> 19:42.760
Getting this disease at such a young age?

448
19:42.760 --> 19:44.000
What is ASD?

449
19:44.000 --> 19:46.400
ASD is Acute Stress Disorder.

450
19:46.400 --> 19:46.880
Excuse me.

451
19:46.880 --> 19:48.320
It refers to a transient mental disorder

452
19:48.320 --> 19:50.480
that occurs within minutes or hours

453
19:50.760 --> 19:52.320
after experiencing an acute

454
19:52.320 --> 19:54.280
and severe psychological trauma.

455
19:54.720 --> 19:55.400
ASD (Acute Stress Disorder)

456
19:55.400 --> 19:56.720
is also a clearly defined mental disorder

457
19:56.720 --> 19:58.480
in the International Classification of Diseases.

458
19:58.480 --> 20:00.240
There will be symptoms like hyperarousal, avoidance,

459
20:00.240 --> 20:02.480
and re-experiencing the trauma.

460
20:06.920 --> 20:09.280
Her psychological evaluation report says so.

461
20:09.280 --> 20:11.440
She will suffer from insomnia, headaches,

462
20:11.440 --> 20:13.760
loss of appetite, and tachycardia,

463
20:13.760 --> 20:18.240
and she will feel uncomfortable around the opposite sex.

464
20:18.240 --> 20:21.240
Right. Just now, when my uncle got close to her,

465
20:21.440 --> 20:21.920
she was scared.

466
20:21.920 --> 20:23.000
Get out of here.

467
20:23.000 --> 20:24.240
Aren't you of the opposite sex?

468
20:24.240 --> 20:25.000
I... I look kind.

469
20:25.000 --> 20:27.200
Sister Long, we must help Jiayi

470
20:27.200 --> 20:28.280
and get justice for her.

471
20:28.280 --> 20:29.480
How can we get justice?

472
20:29.480 --> 20:30.680
The police said

473
20:30.680 --> 20:32.000
they couldn't file a case.

474
20:32.000 --> 20:33.200
Not filing a case means

475
20:33.200 --> 20:35.720
it's not that serious. How can you get justice?

476
20:35.720 --> 20:36.440
We can.

477
20:37.200 --> 20:39.240
According to the Civil Code of the People's Republic of China,

478
20:39.240 --> 20:40.480
Article 118...

479
20:40.480 --> 20:42.000
Enough. It's not your turn to speak.

480
20:42.000 --> 20:44.320
Gu Miaomiao, I have to criticize you.

481
20:44.480 --> 20:45.760
What kind of cases are you bringing in?

482
20:45.760 --> 20:46.720
Don't bring them in anymore.

483
20:46.720 --> 20:49.380
Leave professional matters to professionals.

484
20:50.160 --> 20:52.640
Look, if it were a physical injury,

485
20:52.640 --> 20:54.000
we would examine the injury

486
20:54.000 --> 20:55.000
and grade it accordingly.

487
20:55.000 --> 20:55.640
But,

488
20:55.640 --> 20:57.680
how do we calculate her psychological trauma?

489
20:57.680 --> 20:59.440
What? Isn't psychological trauma a trauma?

490
20:59.440 --> 21:00.160
Exactly.

491
21:00.240 --> 21:02.720
Psychological trauma is just like physical trauma.

492
21:02.720 --> 21:03.480
They are both traumas.

493
21:03.480 --> 21:05.480
Well, I've been wronged a lot since I was a kid.

494
21:05.480 --> 21:07.480
I don't see myself having this or that trauma.

495
21:07.480 --> 21:09.000
I was only ever injured by a bicycle.

496
21:09.000 --> 21:10.600
This case is just hard to win.

497
21:10.760 --> 21:12.720
Look at these fine little cases in my hands.

498
21:12.720 --> 21:14.480
Is it up to you to decide if they are easy to fight?

499
21:14.480 --> 21:15.480
Why don't you go fight them?

500
21:15.480 --> 21:16.920
Aren't I the one fighting?

501
21:16.920 --> 21:18.000
Are you afraid I'll lose,

502
21:18.000 --> 21:18.840
or are you afraid for yourself?

503
21:18.840 --> 21:21.000
Okay, okay, okay. What are you thinking?

504
21:21.000 --> 21:22.330
Am I that kind of person?

505
21:25.480 --> 21:27.680
Then let's fight. Fight, fight, fight.

506
21:33.720 --> 21:35.000
Oh my God.

507
21:36.000 --> 21:37.000
I once said

508
21:37.480 --> 21:39.940
that you can't be a good person in this world.

509
21:40.200 --> 21:41.680
No good deed goes unpunished.

510
21:41.680 --> 21:42.480
Regarding the flight attendant,

511
21:42.480 --> 21:44.520
the police were on my side at the time.

512
21:44.520 --> 21:46.320
Isn't everyone on the internet scolding the airline too?

513
21:46.320 --> 21:47.480
Look at this lousy flight attendant.

514
21:47.480 --> 21:48.160
I didn't sue her,

515
21:48.160 --> 21:49.240
but she turned around and sued me.

516
21:49.240 --> 21:50.640
Do you think she's crazy?

517
21:51.520 --> 21:52.440
Mr. Hu,

518
21:52.440 --> 21:55.080
your purpose for calling me here today is to sue her.

519
21:55.080 --> 21:56.720
Absolutely. We must sue her.

520
21:56.760 --> 21:58.480
Also, the airline that flight attendant works for

521
21:58.480 --> 22:00.280
is doing nothing.

522
22:00.480 --> 22:01.320
They are aiding and abetting.

523
22:01.320 --> 22:02.320
I'll file a complaint against them.

524
22:02.320 --> 22:03.980
I'll deal with them together.

525
22:06.160 --> 22:06.480
Well,

526
22:06.480 --> 22:07.480
let me propose a toast.

527
22:07.480 --> 22:09.240
Thank you, boss, for treating us to barbecue today.

528
22:09.240 --> 22:10.240
Thank you, boss.

529
22:10.240 --> 22:11.400
Thank you, boss.

530
22:11.400 --> 22:13.930
I'll drink to that. Thanks for your hard work.

531
22:14.880 --> 22:17.610
I can tell Ruoqi has a good tolerance for alcohol.

532
22:19.320 --> 22:21.720
Lawyer Li, why do you never drink?

533
22:21.800 --> 22:23.000
Drinking affects judgment.

534
22:23.000 --> 22:23.880
Let me cut it.

535
22:23.880 --> 22:25.000
Affects judgment.

536
22:25.000 --> 22:28.080
I'm really curious about what kind of personality Lawyer Li has.

537
22:28.080 --> 22:30.160
Does not drinking affect personality too?

538
22:30.160 --> 22:31.800
I'm talking about the recently popular

539
22:31.800 --> 22:33.320
16 personalities test.

540
22:33.720 --> 22:35.400
Lawyer Li must be

541
22:35.400 --> 22:36.440
an introvert.

542
22:42.320 --> 22:43.580
Absolutely rational.

543
22:44.120 --> 22:45.520
Boss, let's have a drink.

544
22:45.800 --> 22:47.480
What took you so long on the phone?

545
22:47.480 --> 22:49.320
It was a call from the airline.

546
22:50.000 --> 22:51.000
They said Xu Jiayi

547
22:51.000 --> 22:52.560
has officially sued Hu Sheng.

548
22:52.560 --> 22:54.160
Hu Sheng's side is furious.

549
22:54.160 --> 22:55.440
Now they are making a scene at the airline.

550
22:55.440 --> 22:56.760
The airline doesn't want to blow things out of proportion.

551
22:56.760 --> 22:58.040
They want to act as a mediator

552
22:58.040 --> 22:59.080
to facilitate a settlement between the two parties

553
22:59.080 --> 23:00.520
and get Xu Jiayi to drop the lawsuit.

554
23:00.520 --> 23:01.920
It wasn't a big deal originally,

555
23:01.920 --> 23:04.240
but now it's become very troublesome.

556
23:04.240 --> 23:06.240
Is it as troublesome as my construction dispute?

557
23:06.240 --> 23:08.640
Is it as troublesome as my medical dispute?

558
23:08.800 --> 23:10.640
You two are so stupid.

559
23:10.640 --> 23:12.400
I'm in more trouble than both of you.

560
23:12.400 --> 23:15.160
The lawyer Xu Jiayi hired is Xiao Longnü.

561
23:15.240 --> 23:16.760
What a coincidence. We meet again.

562
23:16.760 --> 23:17.320
Who knows.

563
23:17.320 --> 23:18.560
I don't know what kind of luck I have,

564
23:18.560 --> 23:20.000
going up against her again.

565
23:20.000 --> 23:21.560
What are the contents of the indictment?

566
23:21.560 --> 23:23.080
That leaves me even more speechless.

567
23:23.080 --> 23:25.520
They mainly just want an apology.

568
23:25.800 --> 23:26.800
The claims for lost wages

569
23:26.800 --> 23:29.000
and mental distress are not much at all.

570
23:29.000 --> 23:31.520
Why sue over such a small matter?

571
23:31.520 --> 23:33.520
This might be Lawyer Xiao's strategy.

572
23:33.520 --> 23:34.480
She is combative.

573
23:34.480 --> 23:35.540
I know her too well.

574
23:39.520 --> 23:40.080
Chao.

575
23:41.160 --> 23:41.720
I suddenly feel

576
23:41.720 --> 23:43.880
that your medical dispute is indeed quite troublesome.

577
23:43.880 --> 23:45.010
How about we switch?

578
23:45.240 --> 23:48.570
I suddenly feel like I quite enjoy working on medical cases.

579
23:53.440 --> 23:55.080
Eat up, it'll get cold soon.

580
23:57.640 --> 23:58.480
I'll do it.

581
24:01.440 --> 24:01.800
No.

582
24:01.960 --> 24:04.760
Lawyer Li, how can we trouble you with such a small matter?

583
24:04.760 --> 24:05.820
Is it troublesome?

584
24:06.280 --> 24:08.940
It's very interesting. Not troublesome at all.

585
24:09.480 --> 24:10.280
Bottoms up.

586
24:11.080 --> 24:12.010
No need to drink,

587
24:12.080 --> 24:14.000
but you're paying for this meal today.

588
24:14.000 --> 24:14.760
I'll pay.

589
24:14.800 --> 24:16.080
Then I'll drink too.

590
24:16.560 --> 24:17.280
Well,

591
24:17.520 --> 24:18.980
add another soy sauce crab

592
24:19.160 --> 24:20.280
and bibimbap,

593
24:20.280 --> 24:21.320
one for each of us.

594
24:21.320 --> 24:22.920
Two portions? Are you not full?

595
24:22.920 --> 24:24.240
Aren't you treating us?

596
24:24.240 --> 24:25.080
Two portions.

597
24:25.160 --> 24:27.800
If we can't finish it, we can top up the card. Give us another menu.

598
24:27.800 --> 24:28.760
Xu Jiayi's

599
24:28.760 --> 24:30.480
acute stress reaction

600
24:30.480 --> 24:32.280
is related to a very important factor,

601
24:32.280 --> 24:35.140
which we professionally call a state of isolation.

602
24:35.400 --> 24:37.440
Information isolation and physical isolation

603
24:37.440 --> 24:39.040
can easily make people feel

604
24:39.040 --> 24:41.040
oppressed and sad.

605
24:41.320 --> 24:42.880
Under these circumstances,

606
24:42.880 --> 24:45.320
even a less severe traumatic event

607
24:45.320 --> 24:48.040
can cause serious mental harm.

608
24:49.080 --> 24:49.880
Dr. Shen,

609
24:50.320 --> 24:52.200
let me see if I understand this correctly.

610
24:52.200 --> 24:54.320
Because the incident happened in a

611
24:54.320 --> 24:56.000
closed cabin,

612
24:56.280 --> 24:56.800
it

613
24:56.800 --> 24:58.560
caused Xu Jiayi's

614
24:58.560 --> 25:00.480
uncomfortable feelings to be magnified.

615
25:00.480 --> 25:01.160
Exactly.

616
25:01.480 --> 25:03.760
Plus, she was facing a male,

617
25:04.040 --> 25:06.640
and the other party had an absolute advantage

618
25:06.640 --> 25:08.800
in physical conditions like size and strength.

619
25:08.800 --> 25:11.720
So her psychological fear was inevitable.

620
25:13.080 --> 25:15.720
If she gets an apology from Hu Sheng,

621
25:15.720 --> 25:17.200
will she recover sooner?

622
25:17.320 --> 25:18.850
It will help to some extent.

623
25:21.080 --> 25:22.940
Understood. Thank you, Dr. Shen.

624
25:23.320 --> 25:24.520
Could I trouble you

625
25:24.760 --> 25:26.240
to give me a few different types of

626
25:26.240 --> 25:27.480
psychological test papers?

627
25:27.480 --> 25:28.000
Sure.

628
25:37.720 --> 25:38.760
There are too many questions.

629
25:38.760 --> 25:39.320
I'm not doing this.

630
25:39.320 --> 25:40.520
I'm definitely fine.

631
25:41.480 --> 25:42.080
Uncle.

632
25:42.080 --> 25:44.520
I'm taking a test here. Don't bother me.

633
25:44.520 --> 25:46.720
Can you two stop bothering me?

634
25:46.760 --> 25:48.560
The higher the score, the more dangerous it is.

635
25:48.560 --> 25:49.720
You two better be careful.

636
25:49.720 --> 25:51.240
Come on. Do this one.

637
25:51.480 --> 25:52.560
What is this?

638
25:54.400 --> 25:58.000
That's ADHD, attention deficit.

639
25:58.040 --> 25:59.440
Then I definitely don't need to do it.

640
25:59.440 --> 26:01.100
My attention is very focused.

641
26:04.480 --> 26:06.610
You really don't need to take the test.

642
26:07.760 --> 26:08.640
Look.

643
26:09.080 --> 26:10.320
Xu Jiayi is on

644
26:10.320 --> 26:12.800
'Do you feel worthless

645
26:12.800 --> 26:14.730
or think of yourself as a failure?'

646
26:14.800 --> 26:16.760
And have you ever had

647
26:16.760 --> 26:18.880
the wish that it would be better to die?

648
26:18.880 --> 26:20.200
For these two questions,

649
26:20.200 --> 26:22.160
she checked 'strongly agree'.

650
26:23.400 --> 26:24.480
Does this mean

651
26:24.520 --> 26:25.440
Jiayi's condition

652
26:25.440 --> 26:27.080
is much more serious than we thought?

653
26:27.080 --> 26:27.800
Serious?

654
26:27.800 --> 26:29.080
Isn't this just a questionnaire?

655
26:29.080 --> 26:30.320
If I chose 'strongly agree' for all of them,

656
26:30.320 --> 26:31.080
would I be sick too?

657
26:31.080 --> 26:32.000
You are sick.

658
26:32.000 --> 26:33.440
And very sick, bro.

659
26:33.520 --> 26:35.720
Does Jiayi need to lie?

660
26:35.720 --> 26:37.200
She's telling the truth.

661
26:37.200 --> 26:39.040
I didn't say she was lying.

662
26:39.200 --> 26:41.480
I'm just saying this thing is too subjective.

663
26:41.480 --> 26:42.480
Can this be used as evidence?

664
26:42.480 --> 26:44.000
Dong Beihu is right.

665
26:44.800 --> 26:46.200
These diagnoses now

666
26:46.400 --> 26:48.720
indeed cannot be used as conclusive evidence.

667
26:48.720 --> 26:50.800
The current law regarding physical injury

668
26:50.800 --> 26:53.480
has a very clear standard for injury assessment.

669
26:53.480 --> 26:54.760
But for psychological injury,

670
26:54.760 --> 26:57.320
there has never been a clear quantitative standard.

671
26:57.320 --> 26:59.320
So, many judges

672
26:59.320 --> 27:02.040
will be very cautious about such diagnostic results.

673
27:02.040 --> 27:03.770
They won't easily accept them.

674
27:05.200 --> 27:06.480
If

675
27:06.800 --> 27:10.000
we can resolve it without going to court, that would be best.

676
27:10.000 --> 27:12.560
Director, are you saying we shouldn't sue?

677
27:12.560 --> 27:13.880
Of course we should sue.

678
27:13.880 --> 27:15.760
But suing doesn't mean going to court.

679
27:15.760 --> 27:17.420
It's a negotiation strategy.

680
27:23.200 --> 27:25.040
Hello, Lawyer Li, what's up?

681
27:25.880 --> 27:29.720
I'm representing the airline to negotiate a withdrawal of the lawsuit.

682
27:29.720 --> 27:31.080
You were waiting for my call, weren't you?

683
27:31.080 --> 27:32.080
That's not right.

684
27:33.800 --> 27:34.400
Shouldn't

685
27:34.400 --> 27:35.480
that busybody Su

686
27:35.480 --> 27:36.880
be in charge of this case?

687
27:37.400 --> 27:39.320
He handed it over to me. Is there a problem?

688
27:39.320 --> 27:40.040
No problem.

689
27:40.760 --> 27:42.640
Our demand is very simple.

690
27:42.640 --> 27:45.040
As long as he apologizes, we'll drop the lawsuit.

691
27:45.040 --> 27:46.040
Didn't you sue just to

692
27:46.040 --> 27:48.200
put pressure on Hu Sheng and the airline?

693
27:48.200 --> 27:49.400
Your goal has been achieved.

694
27:49.400 --> 27:52.400
The airline is taking this matter very seriously now.

695
27:54.080 --> 27:55.400
I'll go talk to Hu Sheng

696
27:55.520 --> 27:57.440
and meet the settlement conditions as soon as possible

697
27:57.440 --> 27:58.800
by having him apologize to Xu Jiayi.

698
27:58.800 --> 27:59.640
That's great.

699
28:00.200 --> 28:02.260
Thanks for your hard work, Lawyer Li.

700
28:04.480 --> 28:06.340
It's that suitcase again, right?

701
28:06.400 --> 28:08.760
What? What suitcase?

702
28:09.320 --> 28:10.650
He's so full of himself.

703
28:12.880 --> 28:15.080
Jiayi has been in a really bad state lately.

704
28:15.080 --> 28:17.280
Okay, I'll solve it as soon as possible.

705
28:17.320 --> 28:18.560
Sorry to trouble you, Lawyer Li.

706
28:18.560 --> 28:19.080
Thank you so much.

707
28:19.080 --> 28:19.560
It's my job.

708
28:19.560 --> 28:20.520
Hello, Lawyer Li.

709
28:20.520 --> 28:21.760
I'm Lin Wenshu, an HR executive.

710
28:21.760 --> 28:22.800
Nice to meet you.

711
28:22.800 --> 28:24.080
The client we're meeting later

712
28:24.080 --> 28:25.080
has a really bad temper.

713
28:25.080 --> 28:26.340
Please don't mind him.

714
28:27.040 --> 28:29.080
It's fine. Solving the problem is the priority.

715
28:29.080 --> 28:29.480
Right.

716
28:29.480 --> 28:30.520
Come, please have a seat.

717
28:30.520 --> 28:31.520
This way, please.

718
28:33.400 --> 28:35.530
Thanks for your help today, Lawyer Li.

719
28:38.320 --> 28:39.760
Hello, hello.

720
28:39.760 --> 28:40.760
Um, this is Hu,

721
28:41.080 --> 28:42.000
Mr. Hu.

722
28:42.080 --> 28:42.880
Mr. Hu.

723
28:44.200 --> 28:46.760
He's very busy. Please excuse him.

724
28:46.760 --> 28:47.760
It's fine.

725
28:48.760 --> 28:50.720
Mr. Hu, here's the thing.

726
28:50.720 --> 28:52.320
We've discussed it,

727
28:52.720 --> 28:53.640
and the airline

728
28:53.640 --> 28:55.800
is willing to offer you a free Platinum membership card

729
28:55.800 --> 28:57.080
and an exclusive gift package

730
28:57.080 --> 28:59.040
as compensation.

731
29:00.040 --> 29:02.000
The only thing we ask is that you

732
29:02.000 --> 29:04.530
apologize to our flight attendant, Xu Jiayi.

733
29:05.000 --> 29:06.000
What do you think?

734
29:08.760 --> 29:09.560
Wait a minute.

735
29:10.760 --> 29:11.880
Mr. Hu, the airline...

736
29:11.880 --> 29:14.080
I'm in a meeting. I'll talk to you later.

737
29:15.320 --> 29:16.080
Go on.

738
29:17.240 --> 29:19.040
Well, the airline

739
29:19.040 --> 29:19.760
highly values

740
29:19.760 --> 29:22.000
your feedback and evaluation of our service,

741
29:22.000 --> 29:24.320
and we hope to continue serving you in the future.

742
29:24.320 --> 29:27.450
Actually, this whole thing is just a misunderstanding.

743
29:27.480 --> 29:29.080
It's fine once we talk it out.

744
29:35.000 --> 29:36.200
You guys handled this matter

745
29:36.200 --> 29:37.320
very passively.

746
29:37.720 --> 29:40.480
But your attitude today is acceptable.

747
29:41.040 --> 29:43.300
How about this? I can give her some money.

748
29:43.480 --> 29:44.560
Apologizing is out of the question.

749
29:44.560 --> 29:46.480
It's good enough that I didn't cause her trouble.

750
29:46.480 --> 29:47.080
All right.

751
29:48.080 --> 29:51.480
But actually, Xu Jiayi was also frightened.

752
29:51.560 --> 29:52.800
Please be magnanimous.

753
29:52.800 --> 29:53.760
We can talk this over.

754
29:53.760 --> 29:55.040
She's just a waitress.

755
29:55.240 --> 29:56.200
What do you want me to do?

756
29:56.200 --> 29:57.930
Build a shrine and worship her?

757
29:59.800 --> 30:01.200
That's not what I meant.

758
30:07.080 --> 30:09.040
Look, let me reiterate.

759
30:09.200 --> 30:10.720
I can give her some money.

760
30:10.800 --> 30:12.200
But apologizing is out of the question.

761
30:12.200 --> 30:13.040
That's settled.

762
30:13.040 --> 30:14.440
Mr. Hu.

763
30:14.440 --> 30:16.770
Mr. Hu, you have to accept the settlement.

764
30:20.720 --> 30:21.800
What do you mean by that?

765
30:21.800 --> 30:22.720
Three things.

766
30:23.040 --> 30:24.100
Please have a seat.

767
30:24.320 --> 30:25.480
Mr. Hu, I'm sorry.

768
30:25.480 --> 30:26.560
I forgot to introduce him.

769
30:26.560 --> 30:29.620
This is Li Xin, the attorney representing our airline.

770
30:29.640 --> 30:31.800
He is a top lawyer from Honghu.

771
30:33.560 --> 30:34.890
Let's sit down and talk.

772
30:39.880 --> 30:40.720
Three things.

773
30:43.480 --> 30:44.200
First,

774
30:44.640 --> 30:45.520
Xu Jiayi's current

775
30:45.520 --> 30:47.480
psychological evaluation is not good.

776
30:47.480 --> 30:49.080
If it's not resolved in time,

777
30:49.200 --> 30:50.860
things could get worse later.

778
30:51.000 --> 30:51.480
Second,

779
30:51.520 --> 30:53.200
the cameras on the plane were on the whole time.

780
30:53.200 --> 30:55.080
If we continue with legal proceedings,

781
30:55.080 --> 30:57.280
these will be submitted as evidence,

782
30:57.800 --> 31:00.160
which will cause unnecessary public scrutiny.

783
31:00.160 --> 31:00.560
Third,

784
31:01.040 --> 31:03.080
although your behavior does not constitute a criminal offense,

785
31:03.080 --> 31:06.200
it's hard to clear you of civil tort liability.

786
31:06.200 --> 31:07.760
Based on the current evidence,

787
31:07.760 --> 31:09.480
the verdict may not be in your favor.

788
31:09.480 --> 31:10.480
And the verdict

789
31:10.480 --> 31:12.560
will be made public online.

790
31:12.760 --> 31:13.480
Mr. Hu,

791
31:14.200 --> 31:15.460
please think about it.

792
31:18.200 --> 31:19.260
How should I put it?

793
31:19.320 --> 31:21.880
What Lawyer Li said is worth considering.

794
31:22.400 --> 31:23.080
Thank you.

795
31:33.360 --> 31:33.880
Oh my god.

796
31:33.880 --> 31:35.440
I really, really don't want to waste time

797
31:35.440 --> 31:36.520
on this crap.

798
31:37.720 --> 31:40.000
I see. As long as she drops the lawsuit,

799
31:40.160 --> 31:42.360
I can be the bigger person and apologize to her.

800
31:42.360 --> 31:43.420
Are you satisfied?

801
31:43.680 --> 31:44.320
Thank you.

802
31:44.640 --> 31:45.280
Thank you.

803
31:45.600 --> 31:48.200
I'm done with my meeting. I'll head over to you.

804
31:48.720 --> 31:49.400
See you.

805
31:50.040 --> 31:51.320
Make the VIP status happen as soon as possible.

806
31:51.320 --> 31:52.080
No problem.

807
31:53.600 --> 31:54.840
Hello, Lawyer Xiao.

808
31:55.160 --> 31:56.620
Hu Sheng agreed to settle.

809
31:56.800 --> 31:57.840
Come to Honghu.

810
31:57.840 --> 32:00.360
Let's discuss the specific settlement process.

811
32:00.360 --> 32:02.400
If he agreed to settle, shouldn't you come to me?

812
32:02.400 --> 32:03.800
Why should I go to Honghu?

813
32:03.880 --> 32:05.210
Your place is too small.

814
32:06.040 --> 32:07.320
How old are you?

815
32:07.640 --> 32:09.640
Is this place not big enough for you?

816
32:09.760 --> 32:11.880
You're not afraid to come, are you?

817
32:12.320 --> 32:13.560
Li Xin, you don't need to goad me.

818
32:13.560 --> 32:14.520
It won't work.

819
32:14.520 --> 32:15.640
What's there to be afraid of?

820
32:15.640 --> 32:16.840
You wait right there.

821
32:16.960 --> 32:19.000
Okay, I'll wait right here for you.

822
32:21.600 --> 32:22.280
What's wrong, sis?

823
32:22.280 --> 32:23.040
Who are we taking on?

824
32:23.040 --> 32:23.880
What do you mean, taking on?

825
32:23.880 --> 32:26.400
Li Xin says I don't dare go to Honghu.

826
32:26.400 --> 32:27.600
That's ridiculous.

827
32:27.600 --> 32:29.400
Look how arrogant he is.

828
32:29.400 --> 32:31.040
Showing off like this after winning just once.

829
32:31.040 --> 32:32.680
You must go and take him down a peg.

830
32:32.680 --> 32:33.920
Sis, I'll go with you.

831
32:34.360 --> 32:35.680
Director, can I go?

832
32:35.840 --> 32:37.370
I can take meeting minutes.

833
32:37.560 --> 32:39.040
Yes, why not?

834
32:39.360 --> 32:41.320
Pack up. Let's go together.

835
32:41.320 --> 32:42.040
Okay.

836
32:54.800 --> 32:56.000
The car is in the back.

837
33:08.600 --> 33:09.460
-Feng A·D85NB-

838
33:42.520 --> 33:43.920
Can you show some promise?

839
33:43.920 --> 33:45.120
Chest out, head high.

840
33:52.720 --> 33:54.200
Lawyer Xiao, Miaomiao.

841
33:54.320 --> 33:55.240
Why are you here?

842
33:55.240 --> 33:56.400
Here to discuss something with Lawyer Li.

843
33:56.400 --> 33:57.560
Then I'll take you in.

844
33:57.560 --> 33:58.920
No need. You go ahead.

845
33:59.000 --> 33:59.800
I know the way.

846
33:59.880 --> 34:00.440
Okay.

847
34:03.560 --> 34:05.400
You go over there, to the rest area,

848
34:05.400 --> 34:06.200
and wait.

849
34:06.240 --> 34:07.120
The three of us will go talk.

850
34:07.120 --> 34:08.980
I'll go to the rest area. Let's go.

851
34:09.719 --> 34:10.600
I'll go.

852
34:12.760 --> 34:13.560
Lawyer Xiao.

853
34:15.880 --> 34:16.360
Chao.

854
34:17.080 --> 34:17.810
Lawyer Xiao.

855
34:22.159 --> 34:24.320
Lawyer Xiao is quite imposing.

856
34:37.880 --> 34:39.280
Is the coffee free?

857
34:41.800 --> 34:43.120
Is that coffee free?

858
34:43.320 --> 34:43.920
Yes.

859
34:45.080 --> 34:46.000
What kind of beans?

860
34:46.000 --> 34:48.120
This week it's Sumatra Mandheling.

861
34:49.320 --> 34:50.050
Is it bitter?

862
34:50.239 --> 34:50.719
Bitter?

863
34:50.920 --> 34:51.800
Bitter. I'll take two cups.

864
34:51.800 --> 34:52.400
Sure thing.

865
34:52.400 --> 34:54.330
I won't drink it if it's not bitter.

866
34:58.160 --> 34:59.690
These chairs have no backs.

867
35:03.480 --> 35:05.400
Are these rice crackers free too?

868
35:05.400 --> 35:06.460
Yes. They're free.

869
35:06.560 --> 35:07.080
Okay.

870
35:19.880 --> 35:20.720
Hello. Your coffee is ready.

871
35:20.720 --> 35:21.880
Okay. Thank you.

872
35:21.880 --> 35:22.540
No problem.

873
35:38.600 --> 35:39.440
Hello, sir.

874
35:39.800 --> 35:42.530
You're looking for a lawyer for a lawsuit, right?

875
35:42.800 --> 35:44.160
Finding a lawyer is a big deal.

876
35:44.160 --> 35:45.960
You need someone professional and reliable.

877
35:45.960 --> 35:47.760
Our law firm is very professional.

878
35:47.760 --> 35:49.160
What kind of case do you have? Let me hear it.

879
35:49.160 --> 35:51.560
Our company's legal representative seal was taken by a shareholder.

880
35:51.560 --> 35:52.920
Hello, Mr. Chen.

881
35:52.920 --> 35:53.840
Hello, hello.

882
35:53.880 --> 35:54.600
And this is?

883
35:55.280 --> 35:56.520
And this is?

884
35:57.400 --> 35:58.600
This is

885
35:59.520 --> 36:00.240
the client.

886
36:00.240 --> 36:02.040
I'm here to see a lawyer from your firm.

887
36:02.040 --> 36:03.880
But their sense of time is terrible.

888
36:03.880 --> 36:06.040
Which lawyer are you looking for? I'll call them for you.

889
36:06.040 --> 36:07.040
No need.

890
36:07.720 --> 36:09.040
We should be understanding of each other.

891
36:09.040 --> 36:10.120
You go ahead with your work.

892
36:10.120 --> 36:11.520
Come, Mr. Chen. This way, please.

893
36:11.520 --> 36:12.440
Okay.

894
36:36.960 --> 36:37.680
Well,

895
36:38.640 --> 36:40.170
let's get down to business.

896
36:40.360 --> 36:41.880
I understand the situation.

897
36:41.880 --> 36:43.040
Based on that,

898
36:43.400 --> 36:44.880
let me clarify the order.

899
36:45.240 --> 36:47.240
Hu Sheng must apologize first,

900
36:47.520 --> 36:49.120
then we will withdraw the lawsuit.

901
36:49.120 --> 36:51.520
The airline has coordinated with Hu Sheng.

902
36:51.800 --> 36:53.720
The airline is willing to give him a generous gift package

903
36:53.720 --> 36:55.080
as compensation.

904
36:55.080 --> 36:56.480
Hu Sheng agreed to this,

905
36:56.960 --> 36:59.160
but he said we must withdraw the lawsuit before he apologizes.

906
36:59.160 --> 37:00.520
Which law states that

907
37:00.520 --> 37:02.520
we must withdraw the lawsuit first?

908
37:03.600 --> 37:03.880
According to

909
37:03.880 --> 37:04.640
the Civil Procedure Law of the People's Republic of China

910
37:04.640 --> 37:05.360
and its relevant provisions,

911
37:05.360 --> 37:07.480
withdrawing a lawsuit is an act of the plaintiff disposing of their substantive rights

912
37:07.480 --> 37:08.810
and litigation rights.

913
37:08.880 --> 37:11.080
It must be based on the plaintiff's true intention,

914
37:11.080 --> 37:14.340
and no one can force the plaintiff to apply for withdrawal.

915
37:14.880 --> 37:16.320
Isn't this Doubao?

916
37:16.320 --> 37:17.920
No, I'm Luo Zhi.

917
37:17.920 --> 37:19.120
Yes, your English name is

918
37:19.120 --> 37:19.880
Deepseek.

919
37:19.880 --> 37:21.210
Why are you so annoying?

920
37:21.520 --> 37:23.200
Is it your place to talk about my team?

921
37:23.200 --> 37:24.660
Come on, recite one for me.

922
37:25.600 --> 37:26.440
You still want me to recite?

923
37:26.440 --> 37:27.240
Come on.

924
37:30.520 --> 37:31.680
The airline

925
37:31.840 --> 37:33.600
also hopes you can take a step back first

926
37:33.600 --> 37:35.080
and show some sincerity for a settlement.

927
37:35.080 --> 37:37.200
No, did you guys get it wrong?

928
37:37.200 --> 37:38.480
From beginning to end,

929
37:38.520 --> 37:40.400
my client is a victim.

930
37:40.560 --> 37:42.520
Filing a lawsuit is her right.

931
37:42.520 --> 37:44.040
If you insist on talking about sincerity,

932
37:44.040 --> 37:46.520
Hu Sheng's sincerity is the most questionable.

933
37:46.520 --> 37:48.360
For someone who has no idea how to respect others,

934
37:48.360 --> 37:49.320
why should we believe

935
37:49.320 --> 37:50.980
that he will keep his promise?

936
37:51.600 --> 37:53.840
Yes. So even if he doesn't keep his promise,

937
37:53.840 --> 37:55.320
if you drop the case and he doesn't apologize,

938
37:55.320 --> 37:57.040
you can still sue him again.

939
37:57.360 --> 37:58.760
You have nothing to lose.

940
37:59.360 --> 38:00.840
But the most important thing right now

941
38:00.840 --> 38:02.640
is to calm Xu Jiayi down

942
38:03.280 --> 38:05.200
so she can quickly return to her normal life,

943
38:05.200 --> 38:05.720
right?

944
38:05.800 --> 38:07.920
You don't need to worry about how to calm Xu Jiayi down.

945
38:07.920 --> 38:09.040
Stop pretending.

946
38:09.360 --> 38:10.680
You say we should calm Xu Jiayi down,

947
38:10.680 --> 38:12.880
but you just want to appease Hu Sheng as soon as possible,

948
38:12.880 --> 38:14.000
afraid he'll make a bigger scene

949
38:14.000 --> 38:16.240
and ruin the airline's reputation, right?

950
38:16.240 --> 38:17.040
Anyway,

951
38:18.000 --> 38:19.240
our stance is firm.

952
38:19.520 --> 38:23.180
As long as Hu Sheng doesn't apologize, we will never drop the case.

953
38:38.560 --> 38:39.680
Private court.

954
38:48.680 --> 38:49.520
Crisp.

955
38:50.400 --> 38:51.800
It's not completely useless.

956
38:51.800 --> 38:53.080
It has some merits.

957
38:55.360 --> 38:56.890
Let's go. Another meeting.

958
39:00.760 --> 39:02.480
I sent you that document just now. Did you read it?

959
39:02.480 --> 39:03.280
I read it.

960
39:03.560 --> 39:04.760
Remember to stamp it.

961
39:07.720 --> 39:10.650
Are you going to the Bar Association event tomorrow?

962
39:18.400 --> 39:19.060
Have a seat.

963
39:22.680 --> 39:23.410
First of all,

964
39:23.480 --> 39:25.520
congratulations to Director Wang for leading Honghu

965
39:25.520 --> 39:27.200
to win the bid for Changheng Heavy Industry.

966
39:27.200 --> 39:29.360
In the future, Honghu will be responsible

967
39:29.360 --> 39:30.360
for all legal work

968
39:30.360 --> 39:32.160
during the construction of their major projects

969
39:32.160 --> 39:33.360
in Southeast Asia.

970
39:33.600 --> 39:36.930
This will generate five million in revenue for the law firm.

971
